<title>USA: Seragen holders ok boost in common shares.</title>
<headline>Seragen holders ok boost in common shares.</headline>
<dateline>HOPKINTON, MASS. 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seragen Inc said its shareholders voted at a special meeting to boost the number of shares of the company's common stock to 70 million from 30 million.</p>
<p>Chairman Reed Prior said in a press statement issued by the company the additional shares will &quot;allow (Seragen) to pursue financing for future operations.&quot;</p>
<p>He was not more specific or immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>The company's board unamiously voted to boost the shares on November 6, the company said.</p>
</text>
